sub four.tf by four;
sub five.tf by five;
sub six.tf by six;
sub seven.tf by seven;
sub eight.tf by eight;
sub nine.tf by nine;
sub period.tf by period;
sub comma.tf by comma;
sub cent.tf by cent;
